1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,334
What, you want to
hit me now?

2
00:00:02,043 --> 00:00:03,503
You can't even
bring a decent gift

3
00:00:03,503 --> 00:00:04,713
and you still have
the nerve to

4
00:00:04,713 --> 00:00:05,588
crash this party? 

5
00:00:05,588 --> 00:00:08,341
Allen, show them what
a real gift looks like.

6
00:00:09,009 --> 00:00:10,176
With pleasure.

7
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:14,514
This one.

8
00:00:15,015 --> 00:00:16,266
Patek Philippe.

9
00:00:16,433 --> 00:00:17,434
Fifty grand.

10
00:00:17,934 --> 00:00:20,854
A little fancier than
your wooden stick.

11
00:00:22,939 --> 00:00:23,732
Wait for it.

12
00:00:25,608 --> 00:00:26,484
This one right here.

13
00:00:26,735 --> 00:00:29,696
The keys to
Mercedes GT.

14
00:00:30,238 --> 00:00:31,656
Birthday gift from Mom.

15
00:00:32,282 --> 00:00:33,408
Two hundred grand.

16
00:00:33,575 --> 00:00:34,367
Easy.

17
00:00:34,659 --> 00:00:36,119
Two hundred
thousand dollars.

18
00:00:36,745 --> 00:00:38,580
You two won't make
that in a lifetime.

19
00:00:38,872 --> 00:00:39,706
And the best one.

20
00:00:41,541 --> 00:00:42,417
Take a look.

21
00:00:45,462 --> 00:00:49,049
Half a million
dollars in cash.

22
00:00:49,049 --> 00:00:50,633
Dad's gift for Grandpa.

23
00:00:51,843 --> 00:00:52,886
Oh my God.

24
00:00:53,636 --> 00:00:54,637
All these gifts
add up to

25
00:00:54,637 --> 00:00:56,473
seven hundred fifty
thousand dollars.

26
00:00:56,806 --> 00:00:58,433
Oliver, people like
you haven't

27
00:00:58,433 --> 00:00:59,309
seen this
kind of money

28
00:00:59,309 --> 00:01:00,185
in your lifetime.

29
00:01:02,771 --> 00:01:04,314
They're not even
a million dollars.

30
00:01:04,814 --> 00:01:05,982
That's the
cheap section

31
00:01:05,982 --> 00:01:06,941
of the gift shop.

32
00:01:07,817 --> 00:01:08,651
Who said that?

33
00:01:22,999 --> 00:01:23,750
Sorry, Ted.

34
00:01:23,875 --> 00:01:25,001
Hope I'm
not too late.
